<title>HUNGARY: Balaton Fuszert swings to loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Balaton Fuszert swings to loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating result		25.2 loss vs    234.7 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		 262.2 loss vs     58.5 profit</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	  6,431.7	vs  7,653.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   14.8	vs     34.0</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales    6,147.5	vs  7,158.6</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales    268.8	vs    241.3</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    55.4	vs     52.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 171.0 loss vs    185.1 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    2.1	vs	7.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    173.1	vs    192.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    65.9 loss vs	8.8 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Balaton Fuszert Rt is a food wholesaler and retailer company. The figures were calculated according to Hungarian Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not yet audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
